    "-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\nMIIBgzCCASmgAwIBAgIBZDAKBggqhkjOPQQDAjAjMSEwHwYDVQQDDBhjcnlwdG8g\ndGVzdCBpbnRlcm1lZGlhdGUwIBcNNzUwMTAxMDAwMDAwWhgPNDA5NjAxMDEwMDAw\nMDBaMCExHzAdBgNVBAMMFnJjZ2VuIHNlbGYgc2lnbmVkIGNlcnQwWTATBgcqhkjO\nPQIBBggqhkjOPQMBBwNCAAT71HZy8qBea5nQM+AgsXdAnbTQXxFZI4U0RfvZcrBA\nxRP98Hka38aaXERiwHH2OEXQeAovoDP7d5nPEhD5afBqo04wTDAfBgNVHSMEGDAW\ngBT5HMoqd+NMR6hHynaThUW13l9nlDAUBgNVHREEDTALgglsb2NhbGhvc3QwEwYD\nVR0lBAwwCgYIKwYBBQUHAwEwCgYIKoZIzj0EAwIDSAAwRQIhAOFrAe/kdLJLQhOk\n5YhscltXmkVgu+lGje0yenbg8Rg9AiBhyU4PQgfmqnJgMUdAt78yTueiKwYNgioj\n2zE5A4Cq3g==\n-----END CERTIFICATE-----\n-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\nMIIBzzCCAXWgAwIBAgIUJ4Kf4w/EasKwz/4lA0hfYKKRDKowCgYIKoZIzj0EAwIw\nGzEZMBcGA1UEAwwQY3J5cHRvIHRlc3Qgcm9vdDAgFw03NTAxMDEwMDAwMDBaGA80\nMDk2MDEwMTAwMDAwMFowIzEhMB8GA1UEAwwYY3J5cHRvIHRlc3QgaW50ZXJtZWRp\nYXRlMFkwEwYHKoZIzj0CAQYIKoZIzj0DAQcDQgAEAh3RWm0NxnVV1ncUQAyO/4N0\nAjTmaDGRTxUTRaTjLoTaDWbclQa2N+L4pX9IWWQCtv+s1oV9RMZqk6MUgPL4caOB\njDCBiTAfBgNVHSMEGDAWgBTJFIXVGkxWnbbTrt7/bG6X3xzzqDAmBgNVHREEHzAd\nghtjcnlwdG8taW50ZXJtZWRpYXRlLmludmFsaWQwDgYDVR0PAQH/BAQDAgEGMB0G\nA1UdDgQWBBT5HMoqd+NMR6hHynaThUW13l9nlDAPBgNVHRMBAf8EBTADAQH/MAoG\nCCqGSM49BAMCA0gAMEUCIQDcgKmjNxcYLkQSAJAuFwAaO102gtX0KqQRyzfMQOI4\nGgIgTDkogkhdglRQXxKPISz/QbSkmaQFTWokb9z1fUSK8Ic=\n-----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"
